#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:16
msgid "Your {app} code"
msgstr "Tu código de {app}"

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:17
msgid ""
"Your code is {code}. It expires in ten minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not ask for it, ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Tu código es {code}. Caduca en diez minutos.\n"
"\n"
"Si no lo pediste, ignora este correo."

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:32
msgid "No {app} account for this email"
msgstr "No hay ninguna cuenta de {app} con este correo"

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:33
msgid ""
"Someone, likely you, tried to log in to {app} with this email. There is no "
"account for it, and {app} is not taking new sign-ups right now: log in with "
"the email you signed up with.\n"
"\n"
"If this was not you, ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Alguien, probablemente tú, intentó iniciar sesión en {app} con este correo. "
"No hay ninguna cuenta con él, y {app} no acepta registros nuevos en este "
"momento: inicia sesión con el correo con el que te registraste.\n"
"\n"
"Si no fuiste tú, ignora este correo."

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:49
msgid "Your code to delete your {app} account"
msgstr "Tu código para eliminar tu cuenta de {app}"

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:54
msgid ""
"Your code is {code}. It expires in ten minutes. Entering it deletes your "
"account and everything in it, and cannot be undone.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not ask for it, someone is logged in to your account: log in and "
"change your password."
msgstr ""
"Tu código es {code}. Caduca en diez minutos. Al introducirlo se elimina tu "
"cuenta y todo lo que contiene, y no se puede deshacer.\n"
"\n"
"Si no lo pediste, alguien tiene la sesión iniciada en tu cuenta: inicia "
"sesión y cambia tu contraseña."

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:69
msgid "Your {app} account was deleted"
msgstr "Tu cuenta de {app} se eliminó"

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:70
msgid ""
"Your {app} account and everything in it were deleted, as you asked. A plan "
"bought in the App Store is billed by Apple until you cancel it in your Apple "
"ID's subscriptions.\n"
"\n"
"You can sign up again with this email at any time."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta de {app} y todo lo que contenía se eliminaron, como pediste. Un "
"plan comprado en el App Store lo sigue cobrando Apple hasta que lo canceles "
"en las suscripciones de tu Apple ID.\n"
"\n"
"Puedes volver a registrarte con este correo cuando quieras."

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:86
msgid "Your password was changed"
msgstr "Tu contraseña se cambió"

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:87
msgid ""
"The password of your {app} account was just set.\n"
"\n"
"If this was not you, log in with a code sent to this email and change it, "
"then check who else can read your email."
msgstr ""
"Se acaba de configurar la contraseña de tu cuenta de {app}.\n"
"\n"
"Si no fuiste tú, inicia sesión con un código enviado a este correo y "
"cámbiala; después revisa quién más puede leer tu correo."
